    "notes": [
      "Locked #75 table: Short 52, Medium 104, Long 156 weekly turns; start year 2028; 52 turns per year.",
      "Hold default is 4 weekly turns because #75 left the number open.",
      "Victory is not raw province count. Campaign victory requires coalition war aims plus national contribution plus Momentum.",
      "National and coalition results are both awarded; campaign victory needs both.",
      "Actor-defeat if that actor's capital/control hub is lost and not recovered within 4 weeks. Campaign defeat if the player actor is defeated.",
      "Momentum collapse is a documented player-actor defeat path.",
      "Continue Playing has no hard end year in this slice.",
      "Presets change turn cap and war-aim/Momentum thresholds only.",
      "p10_acceptance is an extra public length preset for the Auto-Resolve soak. It does not change Short 52 / Medium 104 / Long 156.",
      "Earth3 objectives.json stays frozen; this file overlays war-aim metadata and national objectives.",
      "War-aim packs bind by scenario_id only. Omitted scenario_id and registered Earth3/legacy IDs use this Earth3 pack. Unknown scenario_id refuses to start.",
      "ww3_2028_core is Core-four only (nato, ukr, rusa, prc). ww3_2028_expanded New Campaign remains creatable; Expanded victory is fail-closed until a real Expanded actor pack is authored. Auto-Resolve and strategic play stay available without evaluating Expanded terminal victory. No faction-name heuristics."
    ]
